{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18823","headline":"詶冯十七舍人宿卫赠别五韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶冯十七舍人宿卫赠别五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年爲别日，隋宫杨柳阴。\n白首相逢处，巴江烟浪深。\n使星上三蜀，春雨沾衣襟。\n王程促速意，夜语殷勤心。\n却归天上去，遗我云间音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}